{"id":"08b4fd5163a7f955","group":"20","path":"20/20-df-join.md","title":"集合的有效 join","display":"df-join — 集合的有效 join","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-df-join","aliases":["20-df-join"],"display":"df-join — 集合的有效 join","chapter":"1","section":"1.6","source_kind":"book","verification_status":"reviewed","source_reference":"Definition 1.6.19；§6.5 的无限 join","source_pdf_pages":[54],"source_printed_pages":[18],"depends_on":["[[20-df-pairing]]","[[20-df-characteristic]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-df-join"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-df-join</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-join — 集合的有效 join"},{"key":"chapter","html":"1"},{"key":"section","html":"1.6"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"reviewed"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Definition 1.6.19；§6.5 的无限 join"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>54</span></div>"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>18</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"35073b74f84433b3\" href=\"?note=35073b74f84433b3\" title=\"20-df-pairing\">20-df-pairing</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"de14d8d6c42250de\" href=\"?note=de14d8d6c42250de\" title=\"20-df-characteristic\">20-df-characteristic</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\subseteq\\omega\">\\(A,B\\subseteq\\omega\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(A_i)_{i\\in\\omega}\">\\((A_i)_{i\\in\\omega}\\)</span> 为集合序列。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"35073b74f84433b3\" href=\"?note=35073b74f84433b3\" title=\"20-df-pairing\">20-df-pairing</a>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"de14d8d6c42250de\" href=\"?note=de14d8d6c42250de\" title=\"20-df-characteristic\">20-df-characteristic</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}join}\\vdash\nA\\oplus B:=\\{2x:x\\in A\\}\\cup\\{2x+1:x\\in B\\},\\qquad\n\\bigoplus_iA_i:=\\{\\langle i,x\\rangle:x\\in A_i\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}join}\\vdash\nA\\oplus B:=\\{2x:x\\in A\\}\\cup\\{2x+1:x\\in B\\},\\qquad\n\\bigoplus_iA_i:=\\{\\langle i,x\\rangle:x\\in A_i\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{gathered}\n(X\\oplus Y)(2n):=X(n),\\quad (X\\oplus Y)(2n+1):=Y(n)\\quad(X,Y\\in2^\\omega),\\\\\nX\\oplus A:=X\\oplus\\chi_A,\\qquad A\\oplus X:=\\chi_A\\oplus X\n\\quad(X\\in2^\\omega,A\\subseteq\\omega).\n\\end{gathered}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{gathered}\n(X\\oplus Y)(2n):=X(n),\\quad (X\\oplus Y)(2n+1):=Y(n)\\quad(X,Y\\in2^\\omega),\\\\\nX\\oplus A:=X\\oplus\\chi_A,\\qquad A\\oplus X:=\\chi_A\\oplus X\n\\quad(X\\in2^\\omega,A\\subseteq\\omega).\n\\end{gathered}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>二元 join 采用偶／奇位编码，列 join 采用配对编码；两种有限 join 约定可计算同构。可数 join 的计算性必须依赖整个序列的统一信息。</p>\n<p>来源：Definition 1.6.19；§6.5 的无限 join；印刷页 18；PDF 第 54 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-pairing","status":"resolved","id":"35073b74f84433b3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-pairing]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-characteristic","status":"resolved","id":"de14d8d6c42250de","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-characteristic]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-pairing","status":"resolved","id":"35073b74f84433b3","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-pairing]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-characteristic","status":"resolved","id":"de14d8d6c42250de","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-characteristic]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A,B\\subseteq\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"(A_i)_{i\\in\\omega}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}join}\\vdash\nA\\oplus B:=\\{2x:x\\in A\\}\\cup\\{2x+1:x\\in B\\},\\qquad\n\\bigoplus_iA_i:=\\{\\langle i,x\\rangle:x\\in A_i\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{gathered}\n(X\\oplus Y)(2n):=X(n),\\quad (X\\oplus Y)(2n+1):=Y(n)\\quad(X,Y\\in2^\\omega),\\\\\nX\\oplus A:=X\\oplus\\chi_A,\\qquad A\\oplus X:=\\chi_A\\oplus X\n\\quad(X\\in2^\\omega,A\\subseteq\\omega).\n\\end{gathered}","display":true}],"bytes":1321,"backlinks":[{"id":"977206e3aed8645d","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-thm-exact-pair]]；see [[20-df-degle]]；see [[20-df-join]]。"},{"id":"2ca84a186d953c49","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-pairing]]；see [[20-df-join]]。"},{"id":"96978d2a748174af","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-join]]；see [[20-df-tred]]。"},{"id":"c4781c7288e610af","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-jump]]；see [[20-df-deg]]；see [[20-df-join]]。"},{"id":"1a7474d8b25c4444","anchor":"ref-